### Register a new user
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Student",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}